02:20:13,584 --> 02:20:18,304
And it's really, really important to understand, especially if you are building apps.

1581
02:20:19,822 --> 02:20:24,512
For us to be able to understand it, first we need to see the problem and then the solution.

1582
02:20:24,718 --> 02:20:26,564
Then I'll show you how to integrate it.

1583
02:20:26,832 --> 02:20:28,672
So let's just see the problem first.

1584
02:20:28,832 --> 02:20:31,392
Now let's say you built your own application, right?

1585
02:20:31,662 --> 02:20:37,152
You deploy it to App Store, everything is working in your own device and even in the simulator.

1586
02:20:37,390 --> 02:20:42,212
But you cannot really just assume that this is gonna work for every single one of your users.

1587
02:20:42,574 --> 02:20:52,832
Now, like it or don't like it, in real applications, there are always some kind of edge cases, and like there will always be some problems that you need to fix.

1588
02:20:53,006 --> 02:20:57,508
And now you need to be notified anytime your users are getting some errors.

1589
02:20:57,712 --> 02:21:00,964
Now let's take a look at the diagrams that I have prepared.

1590
02:21:01,392 --> 02:21:06,032
So here, you know, like what happens when your users face some errors?

1591
02:21:06,192 --> 02:21:14,912
Do you think they will send you an email or do you think they will delete the application and leave a one-star review with a really bad comment?

1592
02:21:15,150 --> 02:21:21,232
Well, 99% of the time this is what's gonna happen because they don't even know who you are, right?

1593
02:21:21,550 --> 02:21:23,364
So how would they know your email?

1594
02:21:23,552 --> 02:21:34,272
So they'll never try to send you an email explaining the issue. They'll just delete the app, leave a one-star review, and they'll say something like, I don't know, like profile screen doesn't work.

1595
02:21:34,352 --> 02:21:37,732
I'm trying to see my profile image, but it is not even visible.

1596
02:21:38,318 --> 02:21:40,912
I am deleting this app, something like that, right?

1597
02:21:41,166 --> 02:21:44,512
So that's the problem that you need to kind of fix.

1598
02:21:44,752 --> 02:21:53,412
Anytime there is an error, you need to get an email automatically seeing the error, the user, and how to fix it.

1599
02:21:53,632 --> 02:21:55,392
So that's the beauty of Sentry.

1600
02:21:55,632 --> 02:21:57,552
This is where Sentry comes in.

